---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **HostSyncUnitTest** | Validates sixteenth-note (1/16) phase alignment against host PPQ, sample-accurate tracking of tempo changes, and immediate start/stop transport reaction. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1064":{"id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing-18","page_id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/architecture/testing#the-9-integrated-test-suites","content":"| Test Suite            | Scope & Verification Highlights                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **MidiInOutUnitTest** | Tests MIDI In real-time note transposition relative to C3 (note 60), sample-accurate polyphonic MIDI Out dispatch on channels 1–6, and `allNotesOff` generation. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1065":{"id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing-19","page_id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/architecture/testing#the-9-integrated-test-suites","content":"| Test Suite                 | Scope & Verification Highlights                                                                                               |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **FactoryPresetsUnitTest** | Ensures all 8 factory preset programs (`Default/Init` through `Cyberpunk Drive`) load properly with full parameter integrity. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1066":{"id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing-20","page_id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/architecture/testing#the-9-integrated-test-suites","content":"| Test Suite                | Scope & Verification Highlights                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **CreativeToolsUnitTest** | Validates algorithmic pattern manipulation: circular step rotation (`shiftSequence`), stochastic generation (`randomizeSequence`), and Bjorklund's Euclidean pulse distribution (`euclideanSequence`). |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1067":{"id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing-21","page_id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/architecture/testing#the-9-integrated-test-suites","content":"| Test Suite            | Scope & Verification Highlights                                                                                                                                  |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **DSPSafetyUnitTest** | Enforces numerical safety under extreme modulation depths, rapid filter cutoff sweeps (20 Hz – 20 kHz), and high resonance without NaN, Inf, or denormal values. |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"1068":{"id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing-22","page_id":"/en/docs/architecture/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/en/docs/architecture/testing#the-9-integrated-test-suites","content":"| Test Suite                     | Scope & Verification Highlights                                                                                                                   |\n| ------------------------------ | ------